> 1
1   Nu karimni pāun.

- - - - -
Nu=za=kan karimni anda ešun.

Nu apiya GAL DUB.SAR    U₃ GAL LU₂.mešedi    U₃ GAL LU₂.MEŠ^GEŠTIN
    U₃ tuḫkantin    U₃ tawannanan    U₃ ḫaššun ōḫḫun.

Nu šiun ḫarkun.

Nu TUG₂ ša akkandaš DUB.SAR waššiyanun.

The word tawannana is unexpected here, since that is a title of the Hittite
queen specifically, not a foreign one. The scribe copying this tablet likely
misinterpreted a logogram for “queen” and replaced it with the wrong Hittite
word.

